{"id":"94f95e891c920655","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Transitive Reduction Carrier","display":"df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier — ZFC Set11 Transitive Reduction Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier — ZFC Set11 Transitive Reduction Carrier","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier — ZFC Set11 Transitive Reduction Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7dfd7690ebbd5feb\" href=\"?note=7dfd7690ebbd5feb\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,R,A,C,C&#39;,S&#39;\\in V\">\\(S,R,A,C,C&#39;,S&#39;\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,R,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,R,A)\\)</span> (transitive-closure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11TransitiveReductionCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11TransitiveReductionCarrier}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11TransitiveReductionCarrier}_S(S,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land S\\subseteq R\\land\\exists C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,R,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,S,A)\\bigr)\\land\\forall S&#39;\\subsetneq S\\;\\neg\\exists C&#39;\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C&#39;,R,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C&#39;,S&#39;,A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11TransitiveReductionCarrier}_S(S,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land S\\subseteq R\\land\\exists C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,R,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,S,A)\\bigr)\\land\\forall S&#39;\\subsetneq S\\;\\neg\\exists C&#39;\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C&#39;,R,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C&#39;,S&#39;,A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A transitive reduction is an inclusion-minimal subrelation with the same transitive closure. This definition works for arbitrary relations when such a minimal reduction exists and does not assume that independently dispensable edges can all be deleted simultaneously.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7dfd7690ebbd5feb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-transitive-closure-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,R,A,C,C',S'\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,R,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11TransitiveReductionCarrier}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11TransitiveReductionCarrier}_S(S,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land S\\subseteq R\\land\\exists C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,R,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C,S,A)\\bigr)\\land\\forall S'\\subsetneq S\\;\\neg\\exists C'\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C',R,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelTransitiveClosureRelation}_S(C',S',A)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1436,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3420","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier.md|58-df-zfc-set11-transitive-reduction-carrier]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["7dfd7690ebbd5feb"]}